 "schema": 1,
 "comment": [
  "Policy for following xboxrecomp (tools/xboxrecomp_sync.py; docs/xboxrecomp-sync.md).",
  "areas: the first matching glob files a changed upstream path under a research area (one brief, one reviewer each).",
  "rules: the first matching glob says what WiiLibs does with an upstream path:",
  "  vendored  copied pristine to third_party/xboxrecomp/<path>",
  "  patched   vendored, and a patch in third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/ changes it (applied in the build tree)",
  "  port      WiiLibs has (or plans: status planned) its own code derived from it; listed in wl",
  "  concept   read for facts and ideas only; nothing copied (licence notes say why for some)",
  "  ignore    not relevant to WiiLibs",
  "wl: the WiiLibs files that depend on it (a brief lists them); wl_tests: the ctest names that cover it.",
  "Globs: * stays within a path component, ** crosses them."
 ],
