 "rules": [
  {
   "upstream": "tools/conformance/msvc-wine/**",
   "kind": "ignore",
   "notes": "ISC-licensed scripts for MSVC under Wine (Windows, Apple Silicon); WiiLibs records x86 goldens with gcc -m32 instead"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/recomp/lifter.py",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xboxrecomp_pytest",
    "xbox_recomp_conformance",
    "xbox_recomp_e2e"
   ],
   "notes": "patches 0001 (shift mask), 0002 (cvt helper), 0003 (MEMF_SET), 0004 (reserved names), 0005 (fld/fstp m80), 0007 (setp/setnp), 0009 (in/out), 0010 (a body holds code outside its range: body_addrs, absorbed switch tables), 0012 (direct targets with no function go through RECOMP_ITAIL), 0015 (sahf reads AH; fprem and the transcendentals write C2), 0016 (the transcendentals keep a static stack depth), 0017 (integer widths and flags of mul, div, sub, add, neg, shifts; cwd), 0018 (stmxcsr, ldmxcsr, fcmovcc)"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/recomp/translator.py",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xboxrecomp_pytest",
    "xbox_recomp_conformance",
    "xbox_recomp_e2e"
   ],
   "notes": "patches 0006 (--runtime-header), 0008 (RECOMP_BACKEDGE before backward jumps), 0010 (the code a jump reaches outside its function is lifted into it; test_interior_targets.py), 0011 (discover_interior_entries: a called interior address gets a function), 0012 (lifter.entry_starts; stubs dispatch by address), 0013 (--x87-locals: translate_function hands each function that uses the x87 to x87_locals.py, which the patch adds with test_x87_locals.py), 0014 (--reg-locals: the integer registers in locals too, every function; test_reg_locals.py), 0015 (a function with a sahf declares _sahf), 0017 (and one with mul or imul the flag snapshot). Upstream changes to decode_function, translate_function, the discover_* passes or the stub writer need these rebased; tests/xbox_recomp/e2e.py (prog_interior.S) runs the shapes against the x86"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/recomp/__main__.py",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xboxrecomp_pytest",
    "xbox_recomp_conformance"
   ],
   "notes": "patches 0006 (--runtime-header), 0013 (--x87-locals), 0014 (--reg-locals)"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/recomp/test_lifter_fpu.py",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/"
   ],
   "notes": "patch 0003 updates the expected store text"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/recomp/test_lifter_sse.py",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/"
   ],
   "notes": "patch 0003 updates the expected store text"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/recomp/**",
   "kind": "vendored",
   "wl": [
    "tools/xbox_recomp.py"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xboxrecomp_pytest",
    "xbox_recomp_conformance"
   ],
   "notes": "the lifter: driven by tools/xbox_recomp.py and wl_add_xbox_title"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/conformance/cases.py",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/",
    "tests/xbox_recomp/conformance.py"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xbox_recomp_conformance"
   ],
   "notes": "patches 0001, 0002, 0005, 0007, 0015-0018 and 0020 add cases; tests/xbox_recomp/conformance.py replays every case on ppc-be"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/conformance/harness.py",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/",
    "tests/xbox_recomp/conformance.py"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xbox_recomp_conformance"
   ],
   "notes": "patches 0007 and 0015 declare the ucomiss and sahf snapshots in each lifted case; conformance.py mirrors the lifted-case template"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "tools/conformance/**",
   "kind": "vendored",
   "wl": [
    "tests/xbox_recomp/conformance.py"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xbox_recomp_conformance"
   ],
   "notes": "cases.py/harness.py/__main__ helpers are imported by the ppc-be net; corpus/xbe phases need MSVC and are not run"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "templates/runtime/recomp_types.h",
   "kind": "patched",
   "wl": [
    "third_party/xboxrecomp/patches/",
    "wl/xboxrt/recomp/recomp_types.h",
    "wl/xboxrt/recomp/gen_recomp_types.py",
    "wl/xboxrt/recomp/README.md"
   ],
   "wl_tests": [
    "xbox_recomp_header",
    "xbox_recomp_conformance"
   ],
   "notes": "the generated-code ABI (patches 0008 and 0009 add the RECOMP_BACKEDGE and RECOMP_PORT_IN/OUT defaults, which WiiLibs' header makes wl/xboxrt's safe point; 0013 adds RECOMP_FP_PC_CW, the precision rounding with the control word as an argument; 0015 adds recomp_fprem_cc, fprem's condition codes). WiiLibs' big-endian header is generated from the patched template by wl/xboxrt/recomp/gen_recomp_types.py; the xbox_recomp_header test fails until it is regenerated"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "templates/runtime/**",
   "kind": "port",
   "wl": [
    "wl/xboxrt/mem.c",
    "wl/xboxrt/mem_wii.c",
    "wl/xboxrt/mem_posix.c",
    "wl/xboxrt/xbe.c"
   ],
   "status": "done",
   "notes": "Windows-only templates (CreateFileMapping, VirtualAlloc, kernel stubs); the facts go to B's runtime"
  },
  {
   "upstream": "templates/new-game/src/main.c",
   "kind": "vendored",
   "wl": [
    "wl/xboxrt/boot.c",
    "wl/xboxrt/boot_main.c"
